WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
You are very powerful, I will help you

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,160
Now it should be considered that all five of us agree.

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,040
Why don't I agree?

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,720
Since you want to invite us

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,840
Wasn't it your job to convince the five of us?

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,400
Then why is it up to us to convince ourselves?

7
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,040
who knows

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,240
Brother, have you guessed it a long time ago?

9
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,270
Sure enough

10
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,870
Then why didn't you tell us

11
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,710
Did you ask me to tell you properly?

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:33,000
This fat man is not stupid

13
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,200
Just a little bit

14
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:37,540
You are really not a human being

15
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,830
Same as what I said at the beginning

16
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:47,610
For a certain love, five people helped to deal with three things in the mighty camp.

17
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:56,250
Is the condition okay? No, no problem.

18
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:59,930
How did you know that my bottom line is three things?

19
00:01:01,830 --> 00:01:02,870
I don't know

20
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,500
I don't know why you said that

21
00:01:06,810 --> 00:01:08,410
normal bargaining

22
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:11,100
Who knew you would agree so happily
